  leftText: 
  rightText: The latest iteration of the cultist's subservant automaton demonstrates
    their morbid ingenuity, utilizing the remains of slain foes as both a frame and
    a warning. Due to the limited resources present within the Wilderness, this construct
    lacks proper plating, leaving many openings to its fragile internals. This results
    in this model being highly susceptible to short circuiting upon contact with
    water.
